OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow drug services to be
OL,4,Acombined in #2m savings drive
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo specialist services which support
OL,7,Fdrug users in Glasgow will be scrapped
OL,8,Fand replaced by a combined model to
OL,9,Fsave about #2m.
OL,11,FThe city's Integrated Joint Board,
OL,12,Fwhich includes councillors and NHS
OL,13,Fofficials, voted to close the Enhanced
OL,14,FDrug Treatment Service (EDTS) and
OL,15,FComplex Needs Service.
OL,17,FThe EDTS provides supervised treatment
OL,18,Ffor chronic opioid dependency, while
OL,19,Fthe the complex needs service helps
OL,20,Fpeople with trauma and mental illness.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
