OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow drug services to be
OL,4,Acombined in #2m savings drive
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision was made on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fwhen new National Record of Scotland
OL,8,Ffigures revealed 196 people died from
OL,9,Fdrug use in the city during 2025.
